# EAS runs at the Git root. Upload only the native app and its shared contracts.
/*
!/opus-mobile
!/shared
!/.easignore

**/node_modules
**/.expo
**/dist
**/web-build
**/ios
**/android
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.env*
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.jks
**/*.p8
**/*.p12
**/*.key
**/*.mobileprovision
**/*.pem
**/google-services*.json
**/*service-account*.json
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.*
**/yarn-debug.*
**/yarn-error.*
!opus-mobile/.env.example
